Pokémon Emerald 3Ds Dual Screen changes to pret/pokeemerald 76463dac15cad36aca5e2b3f6366abf9e53f814f: French berry tag layout
Applies after 0036-spanish-berry-tag-layout.patch; apply with tools/bootstrap.py.

French berry names are laid out like the Spanish ones ("BAIE ORAN"), so the same
window geometry applies. The BERRY_TAG_SPANISH macro name is kept from 0036 to keep
this diff minimal.
diff --git a/src/berry_tag_screen.c b/src/berry_tag_screen.c
--- a/src/berry_tag_screen.c
